<div class="container">
  <h3 class="testimonial-heading reveal reveal-up">Our Clients Say It Best</h3>
  <div class="testimonial-grid">
    <div class="testimonial-card reveal reveal-up">
      <p class="testimonial">
        Riverside did a great job on our TPO roof for Racicot Chrysler here in Amherstburgh. Everything went smoothly and the job was done in a timely and clean manner that didn't disrupt our sales.
      </p>
      <div class="credit">
        <p class="testimonial-author">
          <em>Jim Racicot</em>
        </p>
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
      </div>
    </div>
